{"parentUuid":"1beb2c19-dea1-4a2a-83d0-5a9af67d867e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01RE83BP6ZLAipZQx3e2Qq6n","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012V5ZTU5irF7hvdtrjcWyf5","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat << 'EOF' > docs/PHASE3_PLAN.md\n# Phase 3: 고급 기능 계획\n\n## 목표\n- 조건부 렌더링 (if 블록)\n- 반복 렌더링 (for 블록)\n- Props 기본값\n- 모듈 import/export\n\n## 구현 항목\n\n### 1. Parser 확장\n- if/else 블록 파싱\n- for 반복 파싱\n- 표현식 평가기\n\n### 2. Markup 조건부 처리\n```freelang\nmarkup {\n  {if count > 0 ? \n    '<div>' + count + ' items</div>' : \n    '<div>No items</div>'\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Markup 반복 처리\n```freelang\nmarkup {\n  {for item in items ?\n    '<li>' + item.name + '</li>'\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Props 기본값\n```freelang\nprops {\n  title: string = \"Default Title\"\n  count: number = 0\n  active: boolean = true\n}\n```\n\n### 5. 모듈 시스템\n```freelang\nimport Button from \"./button.free\"\nimport Card from \"./card.free\"\n```\n\n## 예상 줄 수\n- Parser 확장: 300줄\n- 표현식 평가기: 200줄\n- 조건부 컴파일러: 150줄\n- 반복 컴파일러: 150줄\n- 모듈 로더: 150줄\n- 테스트: 300줄\n- **합계: 1,250줄**\n\n## 완료 기준\n- ✅ 10개 이상 테스트 케이스 통과\n- ✅ 예제 컴포넌트 5개 이상\n- ✅ 모든 에러 케이스 처리\nEOF\ncat docs/PHASE3_PLAN.md\n","description":"Phase 3 계획 수립"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":312,"cache_read_input_tokens":124476,"output_tokens":795,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":312,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CYxmuaTWtFTh8UeQnBceR","type":"assistant","uuid":"fc7aa2e0-ec41-4402-ba8c-48147ae2a880","timestamp":"2026-03-12T07:15:52.473Z","userType":"external","cwd":"/data/data/com.termux/files/home/freelang-light","sessionId":"11d51b2b-7fd0-400a-a001-be95ead172d4","version":"2.1.74","gitBranch"