(프로덕션) - 자동 스케일링, 완벽한 격리\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                  Vanilla JavaScript UI                  │\n│          (HTML/CSS + Fetch API + 순수 JS)              │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│              Vanilla JavaScript Bridge                  │\n│  - fetch() API 호출                                     │\n│  - 상태 동기화 (JSON)                                   │\n│  - 이벤트 처리                                          │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│      FreeLang Core + Node.js Backend                    │\n│  - 상태 관리 (freelang/frontend/state.free)           │\n│  - REST API (freelang/backend/api.free)                │\n│  - JSON 데이터베이스                                    │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│          배포 (3가지 옵션)                              │\n│  ① Node.js    ② FreeLang Native    ③ Docker           │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4442,"cache_read_input_tokens":143266,"output_tokens":1070,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4442,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CYyCMnPsusMjQY6ubcYg7","type":"assistant","uuid":"29337bf8-130c-4fe2-9629-6a194064e762","timestamp":"2026-03-12T12:36:33.960Z","userType":"external","cwd":"/data/data/com.termux/files/home/freelang-hybrid","sessionId":"11d51b2b-7fd0-400a-a001-be95ead172d4","version":"2.1.74","gitBranch":"master","slug":"purrfect-hatching-lecun"}
