{"parentUuid":"a762aef5-7ac2-4da5-a7f5-68eb1947a55d","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"dbd9faef-e60e-4413-a5bd-0c0b47189e5b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WV1CTSTwHywchRW3sDkoWX","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→// TCP Socket Manager (250줄)\n     2→// 저수준 소켓 작업 추상화\n     3→\n     4→fn socket_create() -> Result<i32, string>\n     5→  // AF_INET (IPv4), SOCK_STREAM (TCP), IPPROTO_TCP\n     6→  intent \"소켓 생성 및 에러 처리\"\n     7→  do\n     8→    let fd = socket(2, 1, 6)  // socket(AF_INET, SOCK_STREAM, IPPROTO_TCP)\n     9→    if fd < 0\n    10→      return Err(\"socket() failed\")\n    11→    return Ok(fd)\n    12→end\n    13→\n    14→fn socket_bind(fd: i32, addr: string, port: i32) -> Result<void, string>\n    15→  intent \"bind() 호출\"\n    16→  do\n    17→    // sockaddr_in: sin_family (2 bytes), sin_port (2 bytes), sin_addr (4 bytes), sin_zero (8 bytes)\n    18→    // 16바이트 구조체\n    19→    let port_network = htons(port)  // 포트를 네트워크 순서로\n    20→    let addr_bin = inet_aton(addr)  // \"127.0.0.1\" → 32bit int\n    21→\n    22→    let sockaddr_in = [\n    23→      2 as u8, 0 as u8,                    // sin_family = AF_INET (2)\n    24→      (port_network >> 8) as u8,           // sin_port (big-endian)\n    25→      (port_network & 0xFF) as u8,\n    26→      (addr_bin >> 24) as u8,              // sin_addr (big-endian)\n    27→      ((addr_bin >> 16) & 0xFF) as u8,\n    28→      ((addr_bin >> 8) & 0xFF) as u8,\n    29→      (addr_bin & 0xFF) as u8,\n    30→      0 as u8, 0 as u8, 0 as u8, 0 as u8, // sin_zero\n    31→      0 as u8, 0 as u8, 0 as u8, 0 as u8\n    32→    ]\n    33→\n    34→    let ret = bind(fd, sockaddr_in, 16)\n    35→    if ret < 0\n    36→      return Err(\"bind() failed\")\n    37→    return Ok(void)\n    38→end\n    39→\n    40→fn socket_listen(fd: i32, backlog: i32) -> Result<void, string>\n    41→  intent \"listen() 호출\"\n    42→  do\n    43→    let ret = listen(fd, backlog)\n    44→    if ret < 0\n    45→      return Err(\"listen() failed\")\n    46→    return Ok(void)\n    47→end\n    48→\n    49→fn socket_accept(fd: i32) -> Result<i32, string>\n    50→  intent \"accept() 호출 (블로킹)\"\n    51→  do\n    52→    let client_fd = accept(fd, null, null)\n    53→    if client_fd < 0\n    54→      return Err(\"accept() failed\")\n    55→    return Ok(client_fd)\n    56→end\n    57→\n    58→fn socket_read(fd: i32, max_len: i32) -> Result<array<u8>, string>\n    59→  intent \"read() 호출 및 버퍼 반환\"\n    60→  do\n    61→    let buffer = create_buffer(max_len)  // 빈 버퍼 생성\n    62→    let n = read(fd, buffer, max_len)\n    63→\n    64→    if n < 0\n    65→      return Err(\"read() failed\")\n    66→\n    67→    if n == 0\n    68→      return Err(\"EOF\")  // 연결 종료\n    69→\n    70→    // 읽은 바이트만 반환\n    71→    let result = slice_buffer(buffer, 0, n)\n    72→    return Ok(result)\n    73→end\n    74→\n    75→fn socket_write(fd: i32, data: array<u8>) -> Result<i32, string>\n    76→  intent \"write() 호출\"\n    77→  do\n    78→    let len = length(data)\n    79→    let n = write(fd, data, len)\n    80→\n    81→    if n < 0\n    82→      return Err(\"write() failed\")\n    83→\n    84→    return Ok(n)\n    85→end\n    86→\n    87→fn socket_close(fd: i32) -> Result<void, string>\n    88→  intent \"close() 호출\"\n    89→  do\n    90→    let ret = close(fd)\n    91→    if ret < 0\n    92→      return Err(\"close() failed\")\n    93→    return Ok(void)\n    94→end\n    95→\n    96→fn socket_set_timeout(fd: i32, timeout_ms: i32) -> Result<void, string>\n    97→  intent \"소켓 타임아웃 설정 (setsockopt)\"\n    98→  do\n    99→    // SO_RCVTIMEO / SO_SNDTIMEO\n   100→    // timeval: tv_sec (4), tv_usec (4)\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"uuid":"c6d09911-32a0-45e9-acdd-9af40aa95021","timestamp":"2026-03-12T13:26:43.595Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/data/data/com.termux/files/home/freelang-hybrid/freelang/engine/tcp_socket.fl","content":"// TCP Socket Manager (250줄)\n// 저수준 소켓 작업 추상화\n\nfn socket_create() -> Result<i32, string>\n  // AF_INET (IPv4), SOCK_STREAM (TCP), IPPROTO_TCP\n  intent \"소켓 생성 및 에러 처리\"\n  do\n    let fd = socket(2, 1, 6)  // socket(AF_INET, SOCK_STREAM, IPPROTO_TCP)\n    if fd < 0\n      return Err(\"socket() failed\")\n    return Ok(fd)\nend\n\nfn socket_bind(fd: i32, addr: string, port: i32) -> Result<void, string>\n  intent \"bind() 호출\"\n  do\n    // sockaddr_in: sin_family (2 bytes), sin_port (2 bytes), sin_addr (4 bytes), sin_zero (8 bytes)\n    // 16바이트 구조체\n    let port_network = htons(port)  // 포트를 네트워크 순서로\n    let addr_bin = inet_aton(addr)  // \"127.0.0.1\" → 32bit int\n\n    let sockaddr_in = [\n      2 as u8, 0 as u8,                    // sin_family = AF_INET (2)\n      (port_network >> 8) as u8,           // sin_port (big-endian)\n      (port_network & 0xFF) as u8,\n      (addr_bin >> 24) as u8,              // sin_addr (big-endian)\n      ((addr_bin >> 16) & 0xFF) as u8,\n      ((addr_bin >> 8) & 0xFF) as u8,\n      (addr_bin & 0xFF) as u8,\n      0 as u8, 0 as u8, 0 as u8, 0 as u8, // sin_zero\n      0 as u8, 0 as u8, 0 as u8, 0 as u8\n    ]\n\n    let ret = bind(fd, sockaddr_in, 16)\n    if ret < 0\n      return Err(\"bind() failed\")\n    return Ok(void)\nend\n\nfn socket_listen(fd: i32, backlog: i32) -> Result<void, string>\n  intent \"listen() 호출\"\n  do\n    let ret = listen(fd, backlog)\n    if ret < 0\n      return Err(\"listen() failed\")\n    return Ok(void)\nend\n\nfn socket_accept(fd: i32) -> Result<i32, string>\n  intent \"accept() 호출 (블로킹)\"\n  do\n    let client_fd = accept(fd, null, null)\n    if client_fd < 0\n      return Err(\"accept() failed\")\n    return Ok(client_fd)\nend\n\nfn socket_read(fd: i32, max_len: i32) -> Result<array<u8>, string>\n  intent \"read() 호출 및 버퍼 반환\"\n  do\n    let buffer = create_buffer(max_len)  // 빈 버퍼 생성\n    let n = read(fd, buffer, max_len)\n\n    if n < 0\n      return Err(\"read() failed\")\n\n    if n == 0\n      return Err(\"EOF\")  // 연결 종료\n\n    // 읽은 바이트만 반환\n    let result = slice_buffer(buffer, 0, n)\n    return Ok(result)\nend\n\nfn socket_write(fd: i32, data: array<u8>) -> Result<i32, string>\n  intent \"write() 호출\"\n  do\n    let len = length(data)\n    let n = write(fd, data, len)\n\n    if n < 0\n      return Err(\"write() failed\")\n\n    return Ok(n)\nend\n\nfn socket_close(fd: i32) -> Result<void, string>\n  intent \"close() 호출\"\n  do\n    let ret = close(fd)\n    if ret < 0\n      return Err(\"close() failed\")\n    return Ok(void)\nend\n\nfn socket_set_timeout(fd: i32, timeout_ms: i32) -> Result<void, string>\n  intent \"소켓 타임아웃 설정 (setsockopt)\"\n  do\n    // SO_RCVTIMEO / SO_SNDTIMEO\n    // timeval: tv_sec (4), tv_usec (4)","numLines":100,"startLine":1,"totalLines":313}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a762aef5-7ac2-4da5-a7f5-68eb1947a55d","userType":"external","cwd":"/data/data/com.termux/files/home/freelang-hybrid","sessionId":"11d51b2b-7fd0-400a-a001-be95ead172d4","version":"2.1.74","gitBranch":"master","slug":"purrfect-hatching-lecun"}
