ounded flex-1 text-white text-xs text-center\">Red</div>\n                        <div class=\"bg-yellow-500 p-2 rounded flex-1 text-white text-xs text-center\">Yellow</div>\n                        <div class=\"bg-green-500 p-2 rounded flex-1 text-white text-xs text-center\">Green</div>\n                        <div class=\"bg-blue-500 p-2 rounded flex-1 text-white text-xs text-center\">Blue</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 반응형 디자인 -->\n        <div class=\"demo-section\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">📱 반응형 디자인</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">화면 크기를 조절하면 레이아웃이 자동으로 변경됩니다</p>\n\n            <div class=\"grid md-grid-cols-2 lg-grid-cols-3 gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-100 to-blue-50 p-4 rounded-lg border\">\n                    <div class=\"text-sm font-bold text-blue-600\">xs (320px+)</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-2xl\">📦</div>\n                    <p>기본: 1열</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-b from-green-100 to-green-50 p-4 rounded-lg border\">\n                    <div class=\"text-sm font-bold text-green-600\">md (768px+)</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-2xl\">📦📦</div>\n                    <p>md: 2열</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-b from-purple-100 to-purple-50 p-4 rounded-lg border\">\n                    <div class=\"text-sm font-bold text-purple-600\">lg (1024px+)</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-2xl\">📦📦📦</div>\n                    <p>lg: 3열</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 상태 클래스 -->\n        <div class=\"demo-section\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">✨ 상태 클래스 & 전환 효과</h2>\n\n            <div class=\"grid md-grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                <div>\n                    <h3 class=\"font-bold mb-3\">기본 버튼</h3>\n                    <button class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded hover-bg-blue-600 transition duration-200\">\n                        👆 Hover me!\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div>\n                    <h3 class=\"font-bold mb-3\">Focus 상태</h3>\n                    <input class=\"px-3 py-2 border rounded focus-ring border-blue-500 transition\"\n                           placeholder=\"클릭해보세요\">\n                </div>\n\n                <div>\n                    <h3 class=\"font-bold mb-3\">비활성화 버튼</h3>\n                    <button disabled class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-gray-300 text-gray-600 rounded cursor-not-allowed opacity-50\">\n                        Disabled\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div>\n                    <h3 class=\"font-bold mb-3\">활성 상태</h3>\n                    <button class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-green-500 text-white rounded active-scale-95 transition-transform\">\n                        Active\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 통계 -->\n        <div class=\"demo-section bg-gray-900 text-white\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">📊 시스템 통계</h2>\n\n            <div class=\"grid md-grid-cols-2 lg-grid-cols-4 gap-4\" id=\"stats\">\n                <div class=\"bg-blue-600 p-4 rounded-lg text-center\">\n                    <div class=\"text-3xl font-bold\">500+</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-sm\">Utility Classes</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-green-600 p-4 rounded-lg text-center\">\n                    <div class=\"text-3xl font-bold\">150+</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-sm\">Responsive</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-purple-600 p-4 rounded-lg text-center\">\n                    <div class=\"text-3xl font-bold\">100+</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-sm\">States</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-orange-600 p-4 rounded-lg text-center\">\n                    <div class=\"text-3xl font-bold\">8KB</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-sm\">Light CSS</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 동적 조작 -->\n        <div class=\"demo-section\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">🎯 JavaScript 동적 조작</h2>\n\n            <div id=\"dynamic-box\" class=\"p-4 bg-yellow-100 border-2 border-yellow-300 rounded-lg mb-3\">\n                📦 클래스를 동적으로 변경합니다\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"flex gap-2 flex-wrap\">\n                <button class=\"px-3 py-2 bg-red-500 text-white rounded hover-bg-red-600\"\n                        onclick=\"tailwindAddClass('#dynamic-box', 'text-red-700')\">\n                    색상 변경\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"px-3 py-2 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded hover-bg-blue-600\"\n                        onclick=\"tailwindToggleClass('#dynamic-box', 'hidden')\">\n                    숨기기 토글\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"px-3 py-2 bg-green-500 text-white rounded hover-bg-green-600\"\n                        onclick=\"tailwindAddClass('#dynamic-box', 'shadow-lg p-8')\">\n                    스타일 추가\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"px-3 py-2 bg-purple-500 text-white rounded hover-bg-purple-600\"\n                        onclick=\"location.reload()\">\n                    리셋\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 기술 스택 -->\n        <footer class=\"text-center py-8 text-gray-600 border-t\">\n            <h3 class=\"font-bold mb-2\">🛠️ 기술 스택</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-sm\">\n                <span class=\"inline-block px-2 py-1 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 rounded mr-2\">FreeLang</span>\n                <span class=\"inline-block px-2 py-1 bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-700 rounded mr-2\">Vanilla JS</span>\n                <span c