ing, socket.write() for responses, socket.end() for connection closure\n   - Features: Static file serving with path traversal protection, JSON API endpoints, request/response parsing\n   - Testing: 4 successful HTTP requests verified (GET /, GET /api/hello, POST /api/echo, GET /status)\n\n   **freelang/core/database.js** (180 lines)\n   - Purpose: CRUD database with file-based JSON persistence\n   - Key Functions: connect(), insertBlog(), getBlog(), getAllBlogs(), updateBlog(), deleteBlog(), searchBlogs()\n   - Data Types: BlogRecord {id, title, content, author, createdAt, updatedAt, views}\n   - Features: UUID generation, timestamp management, view tracking, search functionality\n   - Persistence: fs.readFileSync/writeFileSync for /db/blogs.json synchronization\n   - Statistics: Tracks total INSERT (4), UPDATE (1), DELETE (1), QUERY (1) operations\n\n   **freelang/core/jwt.js** (220 lines)\n   - Purpose: JWT token generation and verification with HMAC-SHA256\n   - Key Functions: generateJWTToken(), verifyJWTToken(), decodeJWTPayload(), authenticateUser()\n   - Algorithm: HMAC-SHA256 with Base64 URL encoding, 3600-second expiration\n   - Security: Signature verification, expiration validation, tampering detection\n   - Test Accounts: user1/password1 (user role), admin/admin123 (admin role)\n   - Token Format: eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.[payload].[signature]\n\n   **freelang/core/tls.js** (240 lines)\n   - Purpose: HTTPS/TLS encryption with AES-256-GCM\n   - Key Functions: initialiseTLS(), upgradeTLSConnection(), encryptData(), decryptData()\n   - Algorithm: AES-256-GCM with 256-bit keys, 96-bit IVs, 128-bit authentication tags\n   - Security: IV randomization, authentication tag verification, tampering detection\n   - TLS Features: Handshake simulation (ClientHello → ServerHello → key exchange → cipher spec)\n   - Testing: Encryption/decryption verified, tampering correctly rejected with auth tag verification failure\n\n   **freelang/core/microservices.js